flash-sim License
=================

This file describes the license terms for the flash-sim Python package.
The flash-sim package consists of two categories of intellectual property,
each governed by separate license terms:

  PART A — flash-sim Python Code (our original work)
  PART B — FLASH Simulation Engine and Derivative Components (third-party)

The official FLASH License Agreement (binding on all FLASH users) is
reproduced in `docs/license_agreement.txt` and is available online at
https://flash.rochester.edu. flash-sim is distributed in compliance with
that agreement; please read it before use.


======================================================================
