======================================================================

The Python source code constituting the flash-sim wrapper, tooling, and
workflow automation (all .py files in the flash/, input_gen/,
output_processors/, flash_run/, scenarios/, _core/, config/, utils/,
scripts/, flash_demo/, physics/, projects/, and test/ directories, EXCEPT
where explicitly noted otherwise) is original work copyright (c) 2026
PhySimX Contributors, and is licensed under the Apache License, Version 2.0
(the "License").

You may obtain a copy of the License at:

    http://www.apache.org/licenses/LICENSE-2.0

